\viewkind4\uc1\pard\cf1\ul\b\f0\fs24\'b6 Verse 1\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 1. Rejoice to-day with one accord,
\par Sing out with exulation!
\par Rejoice and praise our mighty Lord,
\par Whose arm hath brought salvation;
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par His works of love proclaim
\par The greatness of His name;
\par For He is God alone,
\par Who hath His mercy shown;
\par Let all His saints adore Him.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 2\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 2. When in distress to Him we cried,
\par He heard our sad complaining;
\par O trust in Him, whate'er betide,
\par His love is all-sustaining;
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par Triumphant songs of praise
\par To Him our hearts shall raise;
\par Now every voice shall say,
\par O praise our God alway;
\par Let all His Saints adore Him.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 3\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 3. Rejoice to-day with one accord,
\par Sing out with exultation;
\par Rejoice and praise our mghty Lord,
\par Whose arm hath brought salvation;
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par His works of love proclaim
\par The greatness of His name;
\par For He is God alone,
\par Who hath His mercy shown;
\par Let all His saints adore Him. 
\par Amen.\f1 
